  "body": "1930s character. Poolside living. Sea views and Narrow Neck Beach just down the road!\r\n\r\nThis is one of those homes that makes an instant impression, a beautifully maintained classic. Where timeless character meets exceptional modern living.\r\n\r\nSet privately behind gates on 640sqm of north-east-facing land, this stunning three-bedroom, study, two-bathroom residence has been cherished by the same family for more than 20 years.\r\n\r\nToday, it presents in simply outstanding condition, inside and out.\r\n\r\nStep through the front door and you're welcomed by a generous entrance hall, beautiful timber floors, character ceilings and the sense of space that only a handful of properties can deliver.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is a world-class kitchen with a butler's pantry and dining area that connects beautifully with the entertaining space, creating one seamless zone for dinners, summer gatherings and long weekends with family and friends.\r\n\r\nStep outside and the pool becomes a natural extension of the living areas, giving the property a relaxed resort-style feel while still working beautifully for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nThis is where the home comes alive.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are three generous bedrooms, two bathrooms and a veranda, with sea views adding another layer of appeal.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, generous living areas provide plenty of room for relaxed family living and entertaining, with two feature gas fireplaces adding warmth and atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe property is fully fenced and gated, wonderfully private and secure, with generous off-street parking for cars, boats and trailers.\r\n\r\nThe double garage provides excellent parking and storage, with a mezzanine above offering valuable extra space for hobbies, activities, storage or all the gear that comes with a busy family.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate zoning for sought-after Takapuna Grammar School and Belmont Intermediate.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Simply superb.\r\n\r\nNarrow Neck Beach is an easy stroll away, and with Devonport, cafés, parks and the wider peninsula close by, everything that makes Auckland's North Shore so desirable is within easy reach. Auckland City is also conveniently accessible.\r\n\r\nMore than just a beautifully presented character home, this is a private, peaceful and wonderfully complete lifestyle property, one that has been loved, cared for and improved over many years.\r\n\r\nHomes this special don't come along often.\r\n\r\nCome and see why you'll quickly fall in love with this home.\r\n\r\nAuction 3rd December at 12.00pm (Unless Sold Prior) In Rooms, 128 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/2P61",
